OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFor the week's final visit, the
OL,7,     FB&Bers head to Steve and Mandy's
OL,8,     Fclassic country pub, The
OL,9,     FThorverton Arms in Devon, where a
OL,10,     Fbelly-busting breakfast could
OL,11,     Fprove their saviour.
OL,12,G2025 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FPayment day brings with it a
OL,14,     Fchance to debate that most
OL,15,     Fsacrilegious of all B&B faux pas -
OL,16,     Fa short and curly in the
OL,17,     Fbedsheets.
