OL,5,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FThe paramedics help a child who's
OL,7,     Fhaving an asthma attack, a young
OL,8,     Fwoman who has multiple sclerosis
OL,9,     Fand is in severe pain, and a man
OL,10,     Fwith bowel cancer who's struggling
OL,11,     Fto breathe.
OL,12,G0010 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FThe air ambulance teams race to
OL,14,     Fsave the life of one motorcyclist,
OL,15,     Fand help another who may have a
OL,16,     Fserious spinal injury. Plus: a
OL,17,     Fwoman has been kicked in the face
OL,18,     Fby her horse.
